flowchart LR
    A[(First delivery SQLite<br/>Kaggle air measurements)] --> EA[Extract air with SQL]
    W[Wikipedia city pages] --> EC[Extract coordinates<br/>and query cities SQLite]
    EC --> EW[Extract Open-Meteo ERA5<br/>historical daily weather]
    EA --> EDA[Profile all three sources]
    EC --> EDA
    EW --> EDA
    EDA --> T[Normalize and merge<br/>city and local day]
    T --> Q{Great Expectations<br/>and exact coverage}
    Q -->|fail| B[Fail validation task<br/>block analytical load]
    Q -->|pass and hash matches| DW[(PostgreSQL india_dw<br/>facts, dimensions, run approval)]
    DW --> R[Python static report<br/>SQL snapshot and interpreted findings]
    DW --> F[Shared feature builder<br/>same-day pollutant readings per city]
    F --> ML[Temporal train / validation / test<br/>Ridge, HistGradientBoosting, Random Forest]
    ML --> M[Saved fitted pipeline<br/>model.joblib and metadata.json]
    F --> P[Python producer<br/>paced historical replay]
    M -->|training task succeeds| P
    P --> K[(Kafka KRaft<br/>india.aqi.features.v1)]
    K --> C[Separate Python consumer<br/>validate event, estimate AQI, persist, commit]
    M --> C
    C --> S[(SQLite estimate state<br/>idempotent event IDs and rejections)]
    S --> V[Streamlit live AQI dashboard<br/>estimated AQI and CPCB category]
    ML --> O[Offline test metrics and predictions]
    O --> R
